    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this OWN DOOR Ground floor apartment with two double bedrooms and two bathrooms. No. 11 Rosse Court Terrace is ideally situated in the ever-popular Rosse Court development, Lucan, Co. Dublin. Rosse Court is a mature and highly sought-after development conveniently located close to a wealth of local amenities including shops, schools, cafés and recreational facilities. Liffey Valley Shopping Centre is within close proximity, while commuters are well catered for with excellent public transport links inlcuding the C1/ C2 bus route towards the city centre & Adamstown train station and additional easy access to the M50 and N4 road networks.\n\nBright, spacious and beautifully presented internal living accommodation extending to approximately c. 80 sq m and briefly comprises an welcoming entrance hallway which leads into the large open plan lounge and dining area with separate kitchen to the front and further consists of two double bedrooms both with fitted wardrobes and the master benefiting of an ensuite. The property boasts a great storage cupboard and a main family bathroom. Both bathrooms and the kitchen have been beautifully renovated within the past two years, offering a pristine, contemporary finish throughout.. Externally, leaving from the lounge room onto the patio facing the front with the added benefit of sunny communal gardens along with communal parking and 2 + parking permits.\n\nNo. 11 comes to the market in immaculate condition throughout and boasts a chain free sale. The property also includes additional features including NEW bathrooms and the kitchen has been beautifully renovated within the past two years, OWN DOOR Access, highly efficient B BER rating qualifying for a green mortgage, gas fired central heating, chain free sale and communal parking. This outstanding home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, growing families and those looking to trade down in one of Lucan's most convenient residential locations. Early viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures:\n\n<ul>\n <li>2 Bed / 2 Bath</li>\n <li>OWN DOOR access</li>\n <li>B BER cert qualifying  for a green mortgage</li>\n <li>Newly fitted kitchen and bathrooms</li>\n <li>Chain free sale</li>\n <li>80 sq m</li>\n <li>Ground Floor level with patio</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Immaculate condition throughout</li>\n <li>Sunny communal gardens</li>\n <li>Communal parking with 2+ permits</li>\n <li>Management fee c. 700 per annum</li>\n <li>Bright and spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Highly sought-after development</li>\n <li>Within minutes of local shops and schools</li>\n <li>Excellent public transport links</li>\n <li>Easy access to the M50 & N4 road networks</li>\n <li>Liffey Valley Shopping Centre within close proximity</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers and growing families</li>\n <li>Early viewing strongly advised</li>\n</ul>\n \nDirections:\n\nEircode = K78 F226\n\nWhen driving into the Rosse Court development, take the left turn at the shops and continue straight, take the 1st right turn onto Rosse Court terrace and NO. 11 is the first apartment on the right corner."
      },
